{"title":"Book Bar Toronto x BODA bookshop meet-cute ","startsAt":"2026-10-19T19:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-19T22:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Want your own meet-cute moment - starting in a bookstore?\nGrab a ticket: **https://www.fatsoma.com/e/s1xf5t7z/book-bar-toronto-x-boda-bookshop-meet-cute**\nBook Bar is hosting Toronto’s first Bored of Dating Apps singles night - an evening designed to bring people together in a way that feels natural, effortless, and actually enjoyable.\nInspired by the charm of a 90s rom-com, this is a reimagined meet-cute moment set inside an intimate, thoughtfully designed bookstore. Expect organic conversations over wine, cocktails (or mocktails), books, and a room full of genuinely interesting people.\nNo apps. No algorithms. No catfishing. No speed dating, no forced rotations, no awkward timers.\nJust good energy, meaningful connection, and a space designed to make meeting people feel easy again.\nOur hosts (think professional wingwomen) will be there throughout the night to welcome you, help spark conversations, and ensure the atmosphere stays comfortable, respectful, and fun for everyone.\nWe’ve also built in a few thoughtful moments to make connecting feel more natural:\n– Bring a pre-loved book that made you laugh, cry, or think\n– Write a short handwritten note inside - something personal, or why you chose it\n– Gift your book to someone you’d like to continue the conversation with\nIt’s a simple, intentional way to break the ice - and a little more memorable than exchanging numbers in your notes app.\nAt its core, this night is about creating a space where people feel safe, open, and genuinely excited to meet someone new. Whether you’re looking to connect romantically, expand your circle, or just step outside the apps for a night - this is your invitation to try something different.\nNo pressure. No expectations. Just the potential for something real.\n**Event Details**\nTime: 6:30pm – 10:30pm\nTicket includes: $10 off your drink of choice\n**What to Expect**\n– A curated, intimate bookstore setting\n– A 90s rom-com inspired “meet-cute” atmosphere\n– Organic mingling and genuine conversation\n– Hosts to guide the energy (without pressure)\n– A respectful, welcoming environment\n– Thoughtful interaction moments throughout the evening\n**Need-to-Know**\n– Your ticket includes $10 off any beverage at the bar\n– Please bring a pre-loved book with a handwritten note inside\n– This event is designed for singles of all backgrounds and orientations\n– While we aim for a balanced mix of guests, we cannot guarantee gender ratios\n– All ticket sales are final (no refunds or transfers unless to the same ticket type)\n– By attending, you consent to photo and video capture for event and social use\nQuestions? Feel free to DM us anytime or visit @boredofdatingapps\nWe can’t wait to meet you.","venue":{"name":"Book Bar","address":"600 Markham St, Toronto, ON M6G 2L8, Toronto","lat":43.664066,"lng":-79.41237,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Offline Dating Toronto - Singles IRL socials","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/9/d/3/highres_534186611.jpeg"}